":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-07T18:20:29-08:00","id":1279355,"title":"","content":"I am unfamiliar with Ant King Meruem, what mythology is that character from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-07T18:37:50-08:00","id":1279363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darklander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1278739-mythical-inspiration-for-inguma-and-talassii?p=1279355#post1279355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am unfamiliar with Ant King Meruem, what mythology is that character from?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> He's from the series Hunter x Hunter, it's an anime.<br /> <br /> He belongs to a species known as Chimera Ants, so called because they absorb the genetic traits of whatever life forms they eat, and pass those traits on to their offspring. At some point, they manage to consume human meat, thus allowing them to evolve into a far more intelligent species.<br /> <br /> Despite the fact that Meruem is their king, he makes it explicitly clear that he has almost zero regard for the well being of his fellow Chimera Ants. He's driven purely by his own self interest, and does not hesitate to execute anybody for even the most minor offenses. This personality terrifies his fellow ants, since their evolutionary process has conditioned them to put the good of the colony ahead of their own self interests.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9jiqcnwrsuk\" target=\"_blank\">Meruem is Born.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}